{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Increase funding and information for families affected by dementia",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "Dementia affects millions and families are often left unsupported after diagnosis. We call on the Government to increase funding to help provide clearer information and a support package at diagnosis, to include guidance, services, and signposting, so no family faces dementia alone.",
